    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "研究者为什么需要「局部线性嵌入」？当时已有的方法究竟卡在了哪里？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "萨姆·罗维斯和劳伦斯·索尔提出局部线性嵌入，这是一种保持局部重建权重的非线性降维算法。LLE 不直接建模全局距离，而是保持每个点可由邻居局部重建。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-dimensionality-reduction-by-locally-linear-embedding"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "每个点由邻居重建，低维映射保持这些权重。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-dimensionality-reduction-by-locally-linear-embedding"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 LLE 视为与 Isomap 互补的关键流形学习方法。它的长期影响在于说明保持局部重建关系可以在没有显式全局模型的情况下揭示非线性结构。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-dimensionality-reduction-by-locally-linear-embedding"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "这条线索还没有结束。接下来来到「t-SNE」，我们会看到研究者怎样把问题继续向前推进。",
            "sourceIds": [],
